[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4627.189, "timestamp": "01:17:07", "text": "你今天让我们感到毛骨悚然，我持续了六个小时。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4630.75, "timestamp": "01:17:10", "text": "几个小时，因为我今天在旅行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4633.03, "timestamp": "01:17:13", "text": "哦，你回家了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4634.629, "timestamp": "01:17:14", "text": "今天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4642.27, "timestamp": "01:17:22", "text": "休息一下，我现在正在吃晚饭。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4645.43, "timestamp": "01:17:25", "text": "太累了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4646.87, "timestamp": "01:17:26", "text": "我不喜欢睡得那么好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4648.629, "timestamp": "01:17:28", "text": "晚饭后也可以，所以我会留下来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4651.229, "timestamp": "01:17:31", "text": "虽然大家都说“哦，但我没玩游戏”，但我还是玩了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4655.31, "timestamp": "01:17:35", "text": "过一会儿，啊，我想玩游戏了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4657.75, "timestamp": "01:17:37", "text": "妮基，我真的很喜欢那个游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4660.709, "timestamp": "01:17:40", "text": "现在我也应该玩玩了，我有这款游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4663.11, "timestamp": "01:17:43", "text": "安装如果我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4666.43, "timestamp": "01:17:46", "text": "相信我，你应该相信我，你应该相信我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4669.95, "timestamp": "01:17:49", "text": "在亚洲演出，做 Suki uh Zuki no cuz"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4671.51, "timestamp": "01:17:51", "text": "她真的很喜欢这个游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4675.709, "timestamp": "01:17:55", "text": "哦等等，你不是在亚洲比赛吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4678.95, "timestamp": "01:17:58", "text": "我，我，哦，好的"}]